SUMMARY:Memorial - Celebration of Life for Neil Kirk
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T170000
UID:6a83a601d5b2c14515709570@squarespace.com
DESCRIPTION:Please join us to celebrate the life of our community member N
 eil Kirk\, who passed away peacefully at his home on July 15\, 2026 at age
  92.\nDevoted to his family and to efforts to make the world a better plac
 e\, he had lived in Occidental for over thirty years.\nHe is survived by h
 is wife\, Susan\, his sons\, Kristian (Susan)\, Vincent\, and Niels (Adrie
 nne)\, stepdaughters Siobhan Xavier (Orlando)\, and Maya Richardson (Andre
 w)\, five grandchildren\, two great grandchildren\, his brothers Keith (Et
 hel) and\, Theodore (Gilda)\, extended family and many friends.
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts\, 3850 Doris Murphy Court\, Occide
 ntal
